      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Another race weakened significantly by key scratchings. It now opens up for RAINBOW LASS (8) who raced on the pace and wasn't beaten all that far last time out over 1181m at Grafton. Has only won two races and both came at this track on heavy ground. Hard to ignore that profile. HOT WINGS (2) is back after a nine-week break. Good fresh performer with some decent results on rain-affected surfaces. Form last prep in some better races than this reads well. Must be respected. The placement of ICEWATER (7) is curious, dropping back from a mile at Ballina 25 days ago. Shouldn't be too far off them in the small field which makes the task a little easier. Lightly raced mare DRAHOMIRA (3) has only raced on a soft track once and scored easily at Lismore. In contention despite two months between runs. COPENHAGEN CAT (6) placed twice in a row before failing as favourite at Grafton last start. Over-raced that day suggesting this shorter trip might be the right move.",
